This package renders the DSH tool view card vocabulary. The type declarations
under src/types.ts re-declare, with original wording, the shapes DeepSeek
Harness publishes as @deepseek-ai/dsh-tools presentation types, so that this
renderer carries no DSH runtime dependency. DeepSeek Harness is Copyright (c)
